            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="sleep" class="block text-sm font-medium text-body mb-2">Ou dormira le chien ?</label>
              <input type="text" id="sleep" name="sleep" placeholder="ex. dans le salon, dans notre chambre" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-gray-200 px-4 py-3 text-base text-slate-dark focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal focus:border-transparent" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="home_check" class="block text-sm font-medium text-body mb-2">Acceptez-vous une visite a domicile ? *</label>
              <select id="home_check" name="home_check" required class="w-full rounded-xl border border-gray-200 px-4 py-3 text-base text-slate-dark bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal focus:border-transparent">
                <option value="">Choisir...</option>
                <option value="Yes">Oui</option>
                <option value="No">Non</option>
              </select>
              <p class="text-xs text-body mt-1">En Allemagne et en Autriche, la visite se fait en personne. Au Royaume-Uni, c'est en general un appel video. Dans tous les cas, c'est rapide et convivial.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="questions" class="block text-sm font-medium text-body mb-2">Avez-vous des questions sur le chien ?</label>
              <textarea id="questions" name="questions" rows="3" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-gray-200 px-4 py-3 text-base text-slate-dark focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal focus:border-transparent resize-y"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="message" class="block text-sm font-medium text-body mb-2">Souhaitez-vous nous dire autre chose ?</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="3" placeholder="Parlez-nous de vous, de votre mode de vie ou de ce qui vous attire chez ce chien..." class="w-full rounded-xl border border-gray-200 px-4 py-3 text-base text-slate-dark focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal focus:border-transparent resize-y"></textarea>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Success stories -->
        <div class="bg-light-bg rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
          <p class="text-body mb-2">Au fil des ans, nous avons aide des chiens comme Bridgette, Nero, Flint et bien d'autres a trouver des familles aimantes a travers l'Europe.</p>
          <a href="/success-stories" class="text-teal font-medium hover:underline">Voir leurs histoires &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Submit -->
        <div class="text-center pt-2">
          <button type="submit" id="submit-btn" class="inline-block px-10 py-3.5 bg-teal text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-teal/90 transition-colors text-base shadow-md hover:shadow-lg">Envoyer la demande</button>
          <p class="text-xs text-body mt-3">Nous examinons chaque demande et vous recontacterons sous quelques jours.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-10 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-dark mb-4">Questions frequemment posees</h2>
          <details class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <summary class="py-4 cursor-pointer text-base font-medium text-slate-dark hover:text-teal">Que se passe-t-il apres ma demande ?</summary>
            <p class="pb-4 text-body text-sm">Nous examinons votre demande et vous contactons par WhatsApp dans les 24 heures. Ensuite, nous organisons une visite a domicile et discutons des prochaines etapes.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <summary class="py-4 cursor-pointer text-base font-medium text-slate-dark hover:text-teal">Qu'est-ce que la visite a domicile ?</summary>
            <p class="pb-4 text-body text-sm">En Allemagne et en Autriche, la visite se fait en personne. Au Royaume-Uni, c'est en general un appel video. Pas d'inquietude, c'est rapide et convivial.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <summary class="py-4 cursor-pointer text-base font-medium text-slate-dark hover:text-teal">Combien de temps dure le transport ?</summary>
            <p class="pb-4 text-body text-sm">Il faut generalement environ un mois pour organiser le transport et preparer le chien au voyage. Cela peut varier selon la saison et notre charge de travail.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <summary class="py-4 cursor-pointer text-base font-medium text-slate-dark hover:text-teal">Qu'est-ce qui est inclus avec le chien ?</summary>
            <p class="pb-4 text-body text-sm">Chaque chien arrive vaccine, puce, vermifuge et avec un passeport pour animaux. Les chiens adultes sont generalement sterilises avant le voyage. Les chiots peuvent ne pas encore etre sterilises en raison de leur age.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <summary class="py-4 cursor-pointer text-base font-medium text-slate-dark hover:text-teal">Y a-t-il des frais d'adoption ?</summary>
            <p class="pb-4 text-body text-sm">Il n'y a pas de frais d'adoption. Le chien est gratuit. Vous ne payez que les frais de transport : environ &pound;500 vers le Royaume-Uni, &euro;300-400 en Europe, ou CHF 500-550 vers la Suisse.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary class="py-4 cursor-pointer text-base font-medium text-slate-dark hover:text-teal">Puis-je adopter si je n'ai jamais eu de chien ?</summary>
            <p class="pb-4 text-body text-sm">Absolument ! Les nouveaux proprietaires sont les bienvenus. Nous vous accompagnons tout au long du processus et vous aidons a vous preparer pour votre nouveau membre de la famille.</p>
          </details>
        </div>

          </div><!-- end right column -->
        </div><!-- end flex row -->
      </div><!-- end form-fields -->
    </form>

    <!-- Success message -->
    <div id="success-msg" class="hidden py-16">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 text-center">
        <div class="text-5xl mb-4">🐾</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-dark mb-2">Merci pour votre demande !</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-body mb-6" id="success-dog-text">Nous sommes ravis que vous souhaitiez offrir un foyer aimant a un chien de sauvetage.</p>

        <!-- Dog photos on success screen -->
        <div id="success-photos" class="hidden mb-8">
          <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden max-w-md mx-auto">
            <div class="aspect-square relative overflow-hidden" id="success-carousel">
              <div class="flex h-full transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out" id="success-track"></div>
              <button type="button" id="success-prev" class="absolute left-2 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-white/80 hover:bg-white rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center shadow text-slate-700 text-xl z-10">&#8249;</button>
              <button type="button" id="success-next" class="absolute right-2 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-white/80 hover:bg-white rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center shadow text-slate-700 text-xl z-10">&#8250;</button>
              <div class="absolute bottom-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex gap-2 z-10" id="success-dots"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-light-bg rounded-xl p-6 mb-8 text-left max-w-md mx-auto">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-dark mb-3 text-center">Et maintenant ?</h3>
          <ol class="space-y-3 text-sm text-body">
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-teal text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">1</span>
              <span>Nous examinons votre demande et <strong>vous contactons par WhatsApp dans les 24 heures</strong>.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-teal text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">2</span>
              <span>Nous organisons une <strong>visite a domicile</strong> : en Allemagne et en Autriche, en personne. Au Royaume-Uni, par appel video.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-teal text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">3</span>
              <span>Une fois approuve, nous organisons un <strong>transport agree</strong> directement jusqu'a chez vous.</span>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <p class="text-body mb-6">Vous ne pouvez pas attendre ? Contactez-nous directement :</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="https://wa.me/38765628636" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-green-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-green-600 transition-colors">Ecrivez-nous sur WhatsApp</a>
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61590021437450" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-teal text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-teal/90 transition-colors">Ecrivez-nous sur Facebook</a>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8">
          <a href="/fr/adopt" class="text-teal font-medium hover:underline">&larr; Retour a tous les chiens</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  // Dog selection
  const dogBtns = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.dog-select-btn');
  const dogInput = document.getElementById('dog_interest') as HTMLInputElement;
  const dogShowcase = document.getElementById('dog-showcase');
  const dogSelector = document.getElementById('dog-selector');
  const dogSelectedBar = document.getElementById('dog-selected-bar');
  const selectedDogThumb = document.getElementById('selected-dog-thumb') as HTMLImageElement;
  const selectedDogNameText = document.getElementById('selected-dog-name-text');
  const changeDogBarBtn = document.getElementById('change-dog-bar-btn');
  const formFields = document.getElementById('form-fields');
  const showcaseTrack = document.getElementById('showcase-track');
  const showcaseDots = document.getElementById('showcase-dots');
  const showcaseName = document.getElementById('showcase-name');
  const showcaseLine = document.getElementById('showcase-line');
  const showcaseLink = document.getElementById('showcase-profile-link') as HTMLAnchorElement;
  const changeDogBtn = document.getElementById('change-dog-btn');
  const dogError = document.getElementById('dog-select-error');
  const dogInfoEl = document.getElementById('dog-info');
  const dogInfo = dogInfoEl ? JSON.parse(dogInfoEl.textContent || '[]') : [];

  let showcaseCurrent = 0;
  let showcaseCount = 0;

  function showcaseGoTo(i: number) {
    showcaseCurrent = (i + showcaseCount) % showcaseCount;
    if (showcaseTrack) showcaseTrack.style.transform = `translateX(-${showcaseCurrent * 100}%)`;
    showcaseDots?.querySelectorAll('span').forEach((d, idx) => {
      d.className = `block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full ${idx === showcaseCurrent ? 'bg-white' : 'bg-white/50'} transition-colors`;
    });
  }

  document.getElementById('showcase-prev')?.addEventListener('click', () => showcaseGoTo(showcaseCurrent - 1));
  document.getElementById('showcase-next')?.addEventListener('click', () => showcaseGoTo(showcaseCurrent + 1));

  // Touch swipe on showcase
  let sStartX = 0;
  document.getElementById('showcase-carousel')?.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => { sStartX = (e as TouchEvent).touches[0].clientX; }, { passive: true });
  document.getElementById('showcase-carousel')?.addEventListener('touchend', (e) => {
    const diff = sStartX - (e as TouchEvent).changedTouches[0].clientX;
    if (Math.abs(diff) > 50) showcaseGoTo(showcaseCurrent + (diff > 0 ? 1 : -1));
  });

  function selectDog(name: string, slug: string) {
    dogInput.value = name;
    dogError?.classList.add('hidden');

    // Collapse the grid, show the selected bar
    dogSelector?.classList.add('hidden');

    // Get the first photo for the thumb
    const thumbTemplate = document.querySelector(`template[data-dog-photos="${name}"]`);
    const firstImg = thumbTemplate?.content.querySelector('img');

    if (selectedDogThumb && firstImg && name !== 'Not sure yet') {
      selectedDogThumb.src = firstImg.src;
      selectedDogThumb.alt = name;
      selectedDogThumb.classList.remove('hidden');
    } else if (selectedDogThumb) {
      selectedDogThumb.classList.add('hidden');
    }
    if (selectedDogNameText) selectedDogNameText.textContent = name;
    dogSelectedBar?.classList.remove('hidden');

    if (name === 'Not sure yet') {
      dogShowcase?.classList.add('hidden');
      formFields?.classList.remove('hidden');
      formFields?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
      return;
    }

    // Load photos into carousel
    const template = document.querySelector(`template[data-dog-photos="${name}"]`);
    const info = dogInfo.find((d: any) => d.name === name);

    if (showcaseTrack && template) {
      showcaseTrack.innerHTML = '';
      const imgs = template.content.querySelectorAll('img');
      showcaseCount = imgs.length;
      showcaseCurrent = 0;

      imgs.forEach((img) => {
        const slide = document.createElement('div');
        slide.className = 'w-full h-full flex-shrink-0';
        const newImg = document.createElement('img');
        newImg.src = img.src;
        newImg.alt = img.alt;
        newImg.className = 'w-full h-full object-cover object-top';
        slide.appendChild(newImg);
        showcaseTrack.appendChild(slide);
      });

      showcaseTrack.style.transform = 'translateX(0)';

      // Build dots
      if (showcaseDots) {
        showcaseDots.innerHTML = '';
        for (let i = 0; i < showcaseCount; i++) {
          const dot = document.createElement('span');
          dot.className = `block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full ${i === 0 ? 'bg-white' : 'bg-white/50'} transition-colors`;
          showcaseDots.appendChild(dot);
        }
      }
    }

    if (showcaseName) showcaseName.textContent = name;
    if (showcaseLine && info) showcaseLine.textContent = info.shortLine;
    if (showcaseLink && info) showcaseLink.href = `/adopt/${info.slug}`;

    dogShowcase?.classList.remove('hidden');
    formFields?.classList.remove('hidden');

    dogShowcase?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
  }

  dogBtns.forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      selectDog(btn.dataset.dog!, btn.dataset.slug!);
    });
  });

  function resetDogSelection() {
    dogShowcase?.classList.add('hidden');
    formFields?.classList.add('hidden');
    dogSelectedBar?.classList.add('hidden');
    dogSelector?.classList.remove('hidden');
    dogInput.value = '';
    dogBtns.forEach((btn) => {
      btn.classList.remove('border-teal', 'ring-2', 'ring-teal');
      btn.classList.add('border-gray-100');
    });
    dogSelector?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
  }

  changeDogBtn?.addEventListener('click', resetDogSelection);
  changeDogBarBtn?.addEventListener('click', resetDogSelection);

  // Pre-select from URL param
  const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
  const dogParam = params.get('dog');
  if (dogParam) {
    const match = dogInfo.find((d: any) => d.name.toLowerCase() === dogParam.toLowerCase());
    if (match) {
      selectDog(match.name, match.slug);
    }
  }

  // Show/hide fence height based on garden answer
  const gardenSelect = document.getElementById('garden') as HTMLSelectElement;
  const fenceRow = document.getElementById('fence-row');
  if (gardenSelect && fenceRow) {
    gardenSelect.addEventListener('change', () => {
      const isYes = gardenSelect.value === 'Yes';
      fenceRow.classList.toggle('hidden', !isYes);
      if (!isYes) (document.getElementById('fence_height') as HTMLSelectElement).value = '';
    });
  }

  // Show/hide rescue question based on dog experience
  const dogExpSelect = document.getElementById('dog_experience') as HTMLSelectElement;
  const rescueRow = document.getElementById('rescue-row');
  if (dogExpSelect && rescueRow) {
    dogExpSelect.addEventListener('change', () => {
      const isYes = dogExpSelect.value === 'Yes';
      rescueRow.classList.toggle('hidden', !isYes);
      if (!isYes) (document.getElementById('was_rescue') as HTMLSelectElement).value = '';
    });
  }

  // Show/hide pet details based on has_pets answer
  const hasPetsSelect = document.getElementById('has_pets') as HTMLSelectElement;
  const petsDetail = document.getElementById('pets-detail');
  if (hasPetsSelect && petsDetail) {
    hasPetsSelect.addEventListener('change', () => {
      const isYes = hasPetsSelect.value === 'Yes';
      petsDetail.classList.toggle('hidden', !isYes);
      if (!isYes) {
        selectedPets.clear();
        petBubbles.forEach((b) => { b.classList.remove('bg-teal', 'text-white', 'border-teal'); b.classList.add('text-body', 'border-gray-200'); });
        if (petCountsDiv) petCountsDiv.innerHTML = '';
        if (petTypesInput) petTypesInput.value = '';
      }
    });
  }

  // Pet type bubbles
  const selectedPets = new Set<string>();
  const petBubbles = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.pet-bubble');
  const petTypesInput = document.getElementById('pet_types') as HTMLInputElement;
  const petCountsDiv = document.getElementById('pet-counts');

  function updatePetCounts() {
    if (!petCountsDiv) return;
    petCountsDiv.innerHTML = '';
    selectedPets.forEach((pet) => {
      const row = document.createElement('div');
      row.className = 'flex items-center gap-3';
      row.innerHTML = `
        <label class="text-sm text-slate-dark w-20">${pet}</label>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <button type="button" class="pet-minus w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-gray-200 text-slate-dark hover:border-teal hover:text-teal flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold" data-pet="${pet}">-</button>
          <span class="pet-count text-sm font-semibold text-slate-dark w-6 text-center" data-pet="${pet}">1</span>
          <button type="button" class="pet-plus w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-gray-200 text-slate-dark hover:border-teal hover:text-teal flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold" data-pet="${pet}">+</button>
        </div>
        <input type="hidden" name="pet_count_${pet.toLowerCase()}" value="1" class="pet-count-input" data-pet="${pet}" />
      `;
      petCountsDiv.appendChild(row);
    });
    petCountsDiv.querySelectorAll('.pet-plus').forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const pet = (btn as HTMLElement).dataset.pet!;
        const countEl = petCountsDiv!.querySelector(`.pet-count[data-pet="${pet}"]`) as HTMLElement;
        const inputEl = petCountsDiv!.querySelector(`.pet-count-input[data-pet="${pet}"]`) as HTMLInputElement;
        const val = Math.min(parseInt(countEl.textContent || '1') + 1, 20);
        countEl.textContent = String(val);
        inputEl.value = String(val);
      });
    });
    petCountsDiv.querySelectorAll('.pet-minus').forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const pet = (btn as HTMLElement).dataset.pet!;
        const countEl = petCountsDiv!.querySelector(`.pet-count[data-pet="${pet}"]`) as HTMLElement;
        const inputEl = petCountsDiv!.querySelector(`.pet-count-input[data-pet="${pet}"]`) as HTMLInputElement;
        const val = Math.max(parseInt(countEl.textContent || '1') - 1, 1);
        countEl.textContent = String(val);
        inputEl.value = String(val);
      });
    });
    if (petTypesInput) petTypesInput.value = Array.from(selectedPets).join(', ');
  }

  // Household bubbles
  const selectedHousehold = new Set<string>();
  const householdBubbles = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.household-bubble');
  const householdTypesInput = document.getElementById('household_types') as HTMLInputElement;
  const householdCountsDiv = document.getElementById('household-counts');
  const childrenAgesDiv = document.getElementById('household-children-ages');

  function updateHouseholdCounts() {
    if (!householdCountsDiv) return;
    householdCountsDiv.innerHTML = '';
    selectedHousehold.forEach((person) => {
      const row = document.createElement('div');
      row.className = 'flex items-center gap-3';
      row.innerHTML = `
        <label class="text-sm text-slate-dark w-32">${person}</label>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <button type="button" class="hh-minus w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-gray-200 text-slate-dark hover:border-teal hover:text-teal flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold" data-person="${person}">-</button>
          <span class="hh-count text-sm font-semibold text-slate-dark w-6 text-center" data-person="${person}">1</span>
          <button type="button" class="hh-plus w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-gray-200 text-slate-dark hover:border-teal hover:text-teal flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold" data-person="${person}">+</button>
        </div>
        <input type="hidden" name="household_count_${person.toLowerCase().replace(/[\s\/]/g, '_')}" value="1" class="hh-count-input" data-person="${person}" />
      `;
      householdCountsDiv.appendChild(row);
    });
    householdCountsDiv.querySelectorAll('.hh-plus').forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const person = (btn as HTMLElement).dataset.person!;
        const countEl = householdCountsDiv!.querySelector(`.hh-count[data-person="${person}"]`) as HTMLElement;
        const inputEl = householdCountsDiv!.querySelector(`.hh-count-input[data-person="${person}"]`) as HTMLInputElement;
        const val = Math.min(parseInt(countEl.textContent || '1') + 1, 20);
        countEl.textContent = String(val);
        inputEl.value = String(val);
      });
    });
    householdCountsDiv.querySelectorAll('.hh-minus').forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const person = (btn as HTMLElement).dataset.person!;
        const countEl = householdCountsDiv!.querySelector(`.hh-count[data-person="${person}"]`) as HTMLElement;
        const inputEl = householdCountsDiv!.querySelector(`.hh-count-input[data-person="${person}"]`) as HTMLInputElement;
        const val = Math.max(parseInt(countEl.textContent || '1') - 1, 1);
        countEl.textContent = String(val);
        inputEl.value = String(val);
      });
    });
    if (householdTypesInput) {
      householdTypesInput.value = selectedHousehold.size > 0 ? Array.from(selectedHousehold).join(', ') : 'Just me';
    }
    if (childrenAgesDiv) {
      childrenAgesDiv.classList.toggle('hidden', !selectedHousehold.has('Children'));
    }
  }

  householdBubbles.forEach((bubble) => {
    bubble.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const person = bubble.dataset.person!;
      if (selectedHousehold.has(person)) {
        selectedHousehold.delete(person);
        bubble.classList.remove('bg-teal', 'text-white', 'border-teal');
        bubble.classList.add('text-body', 'border-gray-200');
      } else {
        selectedHousehold.add(person);
        bubble.classList.add('bg-teal', 'text-white', 'border-teal');
        bubble.classList.remove('text-body', 'border-gray-200');
      }
      updateHouseholdCounts();
    });
  });

  petBubbles.forEach((bubble) => {
    bubble.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const pet = bubble.dataset.pet!;
      if (selectedPets.has(pet)) {
        selectedPets.delete(pet);
        bubble.classList.remove('bg-teal', 'text-white', 'border-teal');
        bubble.classList.add('text-body', 'border-gray-200');
      } else {
        selectedPets.add(pet);
        bubble.classList.add('bg-teal', 'text-white', 'border-teal');
        bubble.classList.remove('text-body', 'border-gray-200');
      }
      updatePetCounts();
    });
  });

  // Handle form submission
  const form = document.getElementById('adopt-form') as HTMLFormElement;
  const successMsg = document.getElementById('success-msg');
  const submitBtn = document.getElementById('submit-btn') as HTMLButtonElement;

  if (form && successMsg) {
    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();

      // Validate dog selection
      if (!dogInput.value) {
        dogError?.classList.remove('hidden');
        dogSelector?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
        return;
      }

      submitBtn.disabled = true;
      submitBtn.textContent = 'Envoi en cours...';

      // Build WhatsApp click-to-chat link
      const phoneInput = (document.getElementById('phone') as HTMLInputElement)?.value || '';
      const cleanPhone = phoneInput.replace(/[\s\-\(\)]/g, '').replace(/^\+/, '');
      const applicantName = (document.getElementById('name') as HTMLInputElement)?.value || '';
      const selectedDogName = dogInput.value;
      const waMessage = encodeURIComponent(`Hi ${applicantName}! This is My Paws Bosnia. We received your adoption application${selectedDogName && selectedDogName !== 'Not sure yet' ? ` for ${selectedDogName}` : ''}. We'd love to chat with you about the next steps!`);
      const waLink = document.getElementById('whatsapp_link') as HTMLInputElement;
      if (waLink && cleanPhone) {
        waLink.value = `https://wa.me/${cleanPhone}?text=${waMessage}`;
      }

      try {
        const res = await fetch(form.action, {
          method: 'POST',
          body: new FormData(form),
        });

        if (res.ok) {
          if (selectedDogName && selectedDogName !== 'Not sure yet') {
            const successText = document.getElementById('success-dog-text');
            if (successText) {
              successText.textContent = `Nous sommes ravis que vous vous interessiez a ${selectedDogName} ! Voici la suite.`;
            }
            // Show dog photos on success screen
            const successPhotos = document.getElementById('success-photos');
            const successTrack = document.getElementById('success-track');
            const successDotsEl = document.getElementById('success-dots');
            const tmpl = document.querySelector(`template[data-dog-photos="${selectedDogName}"]`);
            if (successPhotos && successTrack && successDotsEl && tmpl) {
              successTrack.innerHTML = '';
              successDotsEl.innerHTML = '';
              const imgs = tmpl.content.querySelectorAll('img');
              let sCurrent = 0;
              const sCount = imgs.length;
              imgs.forEach((img) => {
                const slide = document.createElement('div');
                slide.className = 'w-full h-full flex-shrink-0';
                const newImg = document.createElement('img');
                newImg.src = img.src;
                newImg.alt = img.alt;
                newImg.className = 'w-full h-full object-cover object-top';
                slide.appendChild(newImg);
                successTrack.appendChild(slide);
              });
              for (let i = 0; i < sCount; i++) {
                const dot = document.createElement('span');
                dot.className = `block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full ${i === 0 ? 'bg-white' : 'bg-white/50'} transition-colors`;
                successDotsEl.appendChild(dot);
              }
              function sGoTo(i: number) {
                sCurrent = (i + sCount) % sCount;
                successTrack!.style.transform = `translateX(-${sCurrent * 100}%)`;
                successDotsEl!.querySelectorAll('span').forEach((d, idx) => {
                  d.className = `block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full ${idx === sCurrent ? 'bg-white' : 'bg-white/50'} transition-colors`;
                });
              }
              document.getElementById('success-prev')?.addEventListener('click', () => sGoTo(sCurrent - 1));
              document.getElementById('success-next')?.addEventListener('click', () => sGoTo(sCurrent + 1));
              successPhotos.classList.remove('hidden');
            }
          }
          form.classList.add('hidden');
          successMsg.classList.remove('hidden');
          window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });
        } else {
          throw new Error('Failed');
        }
      } catch {
        submitBtn.disabled = false;
        submitBtn.textContent = 'Envoyer la demande';
        alert('Une erreur s\'est produite. Veuillez reessayer ou nous contacter directement sur Facebook ou WhatsApp.');
      }
    });
  }
</script>
